      "policy_id": "DEMO-AML-002",
      "chunk_id": "DEMO-AML-002#001",
      "text": "Transaction velocity and rapid movement\nThis synthetic demo policy treats a rapid burst of transactions within twenty-four hours as a velocity indicator. Review should consider whether multiple transfers show rapid movement through the account, whether amounts are split across payments, and whether the activity differs from the known historical pattern. Velocity evidence should be combined with validated transaction facts and recorded in the investigation rationale.",
