      "policy_id": "DEMO-AML-003",
      "chunk_id": "DEMO-AML-003#001",
      "text": "Account network and shared counterparty indicators\nThis synthetic demo policy directs investigators to review network relationships when accounts have many counterparties, repeated direct transactions, counterparties shared by both sides of a payment, or a high concentration of value sent to one counterparty. These graph indicators are explainable leads rather than proof of wrongdoing. The reviewer should preserve the relevant account identifiers, counts, and concentration measure as evidence.",
